  "text": "NV5000-N - M.2 SSD - Netac NV5000-N NV5000-N 500GB 1TB • NVMe M.2 PCIe Gen 4 x4 interface • Supports S.M.A.R.T./TRIM Command/NCQ • Support PS5 M.2 expansion NV5000-N M.2 PCIE SSD NV5000-N uses PCIe Gen 4 ×4 channels, high bandwidth, low latency FEATURE PCIe Gen 4 ×4 Interface With NV5000-N strong performance, it creates an excellent performance in file transfer, material loading, and game reading 3D NAND Flash Selected 3D NAND Flash chips, which have higher capacity density and reliability than 2D structure, and also supports LDPC Intelligent Error Correction Increasing Game Storage The NV5000-N SSD can meet the expansion requirements of PS5, and easily upgrade with faster boot-ups experienced SPECIFICATION Brand Netac Interface M.2 2280 Channel PCIe Gen 4 x4 Capacity 500GB 1TB Max. Sequential Read (MB/s) 4800 4800 Max. Sequential Write (MB/s) 2700 4600 Max. Random Read (IOPS) 200K 400K Max. Random Write (IOPS) 440K 530K Total Bytes Written (TBW) 320 640 NAND Flash 3D NAND Flash Operating Temperature 0℃-70℃ Storage Temperature -40℃-85℃ Size 80 x 22 x 3 mm Warranty 5-year NV5000-N Datasheet",
